        id: "section-11-conclusion",
        type: "paragraph",
        content:
          "The process is now more transparent, but also more stringent. For true NRI candidates, the path is clear. For sponsored aspirants, the key challenge lies in obtaining a valid embassy-issued certificate under the revised norms.",
