              "Q1: What categories are eligible in NEET PG 2025 AIQ counselling?",
            answer:
              "A: General (40.5%), OBC (27%), SC (15%), ST (7.5%), EWS (10%), PWD (5% horizontal across all categories). The category selected during exam registration determines eligibility; changes permitted only during MCC counselling for those registered under reserved categories.",
