          "Every year, MCC and state authorities publish a seat matrix showing the number of available seats by college, branch, and category. This helps candidates plan their choice-filling strategy effectively.\n\nFor NEET PG 2025:\n\n• AIQ seat matrix → MCC official site.\n\n• State seat matrix → respective state counselling sites.\n\nPrevious year's cutoff trends show:\n\n• Top clinical branches (like Radiology, Dermatology, Medicine) close early in AIQ Round 1.\n\n• Moderate branches (like Anesthesia, Pediatrics) are often available till Round 2 or Mop-Up. Analyzing these trends ensures informed decision-making.",
