          "These are institutions you would be comfortable joining without regret. They may not be flashy, but they offer good academics, exposure, and stability. Many students later realise they are happier in a strong state medical college than in a high-fee private setup. Never underestimate this category; it is your safety net during NEET PG counselling Round 3 and beyond.",
