        id: "section-1-conclusion",
        type: "paragraph",
        content:
          "Unlike bedside specialties that focus on individual encounters, clinical pharmacology trains you to influence therapy at scale, through guidelines, trials, drug safety systems, and policy. Although you finally learn to think automatically, methodically, and critically called a skill set that will always remains valuable long after the major protocols and fashions change.",
