        content:
          "If you have the practical experience and hands-on experience with the linear accelerators (LINACs), consider them as a major factor of confidence and employability after your residency. On the other hand, the institutional reputation is all that matters, where you can see the real-world exposure perfectly that defines the perfect outcomes across the best radiation oncology residency programs.",
